<title>USA: Franklin Electric approves share buyback.</title>
<headline>Franklin Electric approves share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>BLUFFTON, Ind. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Electric Co said on Monday its board authorized the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares of its common stock from time to time, depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>At October 21, the manufacturer of submersible electric motors had 6,361,866 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
